<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Treasury details exchange auctions.</title>
<headline>Belgian Treasury details exchange auctions.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury on Monday gave the following details of its upcoming exchange auctions:</p>
<p>Exchange auction of February 4, 1997:</p>
<p>OLOS 266, 254 against OLOs 260, 285, 251, 286.</p>
<p>Exchange auction of February 18, 1997:</p>
<p>OLO 248 against OLOS 264, 252, 251, 273, 286.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
